{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eOkizLVKUO1794872151.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄羅斯總統普京高度評價朝鮮部隊在俄、烏戰事中對俄方的貢獻。</p><p></p><p>普京周一在克里姆林宮會晤到訪的朝鮮勞動黨中央委員會書記趙甬元時表示，朝鮮部隊參與解放俄羅斯庫爾斯克州領土，成為兩國戰鬥友誼編年史的新篇章。他高度評價朝鮮部隊對庫爾斯克土地恢復和平生活的貢獻，又表示高度珍視雙方之間形成的務實、友好關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.300879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.423748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:49.419118+00:00","content_hash":"d8ee389ba476f15b47594affd317642aacd7e9e33c96f14476ca7673a934c780","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.300879+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}